WEBVTT

1
00:00:06.067 --> 00:00:08.533
That's my brother Bada.

2
00:00:08.534 --> 00:00:10.341
He is sad today.

3
00:00:10.342 --> 00:00:15.080
He misses our grandmother's dog, King.

4
00:00:15.081 --> 00:00:20.298
Bada: Mommy, I want Grandma to come over to our house.

5
00:00:20.299 --> 00:00:22.102
Can I call her?

6
00:00:22.103 --> 00:00:25.514
Mom: Okay, but let me dial.

7
00:00:25.515 --> 00:00:28.976
Bada: Hello? Grandma, it's me.

8
00:00:28.977 --> 00:00:33.427
Grandma: Hi, Sweetie, how are you?

9
00:00:33.428 --> 00:00:37.739
Bada: I'm fine. Grandma, can I talk to King?

10
00:00:37.740 --> 00:00:39.037
Grandma: Sure.

11
00:00:39.038 --> 00:00:42.199
Bada: King! Hey King! I miss you.

12
00:00:42.200 --> 00:00:45.401
Bada: King, when are you coming to see me?

13
00:00:45.402 --> 00:00:52.223
Bada: I hope to see you next week, okay?

14
00:00:52.224 --> 00:00:54.921
Grandma: King looks very happy.

15
00:00:54.922 --> 00:00:57.590
What were you two talking about?

16
00:00:57.591 --> 00:01:01.037
Bada: I want King to visit me next week.

17
00:01:01.038 --> 00:01:06.032
Grandma: Sure, we'll visit you next week.

18
00:01:06.033 --> 00:01:08.537
Mom: Bada, what are you doing?

19
00:01:08.538 --> 00:01:11.194
Bada: I'm waiting for Grandma and King.

20
00:01:11.195 --> 00:01:13.585
Mom: They won't be here until lunchtime.

21
00:01:13.586 --> 00:01:15.851
Why don't you help me make lunch?

22
00:01:15.852 --> 00:01:19.740
Bada: Okay. They're here!

23
00:01:19.741 --> 00:01:23.120
Bada: Hello, Grandma! Hello, King.

24
00:01:23.121 --> 00:01:25.717
I have a present for you.

25
00:01:25.718 --> 00:01:29.931
Bada: Look, this toy puppy looks just like you.

26
00:01:29.932 --> 00:01:33.072
Grandma: I think King's scared.

27
00:01:33.073 --> 00:01:38.603
Bada: See, King, it's just a toy.

28
00:01:38.604 --> 00:01:42.095
Bada: King, sit! Good boy!

29
00:01:42.096 --> 00:01:44.089
Here's a treat for you.

30
00:01:44.090 --> 00:01:48.226
Bada: King, down! Very good, King.

31
00:01:48.227 --> 00:01:50.414
Bada: Let's try one more.

32
00:01:50.415 --> 00:01:53.056
King, roll over!

33
00:01:53.057 --> 00:01:59.840
What a smart boy, King!

34
00:01:59.841 --> 00:02:02.905
Grandma: Well, it's time to go.

35
00:02:02.906 --> 00:02:05.322
Bada: Oh, don't go.

36
00:02:05.323 --> 00:02:08.123
Can't you stay a little longer?

37
00:02:08.124 --> 00:02:12.150
Grandma: No, I have an important appointment tomorrow.

38
00:02:12.151 --> 00:02:14.236
I have to leave now.

39
00:02:14.237 --> 00:02:24.483
Bada: Okay. Bye, Grandma. Bye, King.

40
00:02:24.484 --> 00:02:27.340
Mom: It was nice seeing Grandma and King.

41
00:02:27.341 --> 00:02:32.283
Bada: Yes, I miss King already.

42
00:02:32.284 --> 00:02:35.282
My brother Bada loves animals.

43
00:02:35.283 --> 00:02:45.913
He loves King best.
